<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pago Confirmado</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .container {
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #48bb78;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }
    .success-icon {
      font-size: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      background: #c6f6d5;
      color: #22543d;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .payment-summary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .payment-summary h2 {
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .payment-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }
    .payment-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding-top: 15px;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .event-details {
      background: #f7fafc;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .event-details h3 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      color: #2d3748;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      padding: 8px 0;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #4a5568;
      min-width: 120px;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #edf2f7;
      border-left: 4px solid #48bb78;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #a0aec0;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="success-icon">✅</div>
      <span class="badge">PAGO EXITOSO</span>
      <h1>¡Pago confirmado!</h1>
      <p>Hola {{nombreUsuario}}, tu pago ha sido procesado correctamente</p>
    </div>

    <div class="payment-summary">
      <h2>Resumen del pago</h2>
      <div class="payment-row">
        <span>Monto</span>
        <span>${{monto}} USD</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payment-row">
        <span>Método de pago</span>
        <span>{{metodoPago}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payment-row">
        <span>ID de transacción</span>
        <span>{{transaccionId}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payment-row">
        <span>Fecha</span>
        <span>{{fechaPago}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payment-row">
        <span>Total pagado</span>
        <span>${{monto}} USD</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="event-details">
      <h3>Detalles del evento</h3>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <span class="detail-label">Evento:</span>
        <span>{{tituloEvento}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <span class="detail-label">Fecha inicio:</span>
        <span>{{fechaInicio}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <span class="detail-label">Fecha fin:</span>
        <span>{{fechaFin}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <span class="detail-label">Modalidad:</span>
        <span>{{modalidad}}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>✓ Inscripción confirmada</strong></p>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;">Tu plaza está asegurada. Recibirás un recordatorio antes del evento y un certificado al finalizar.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
      <a href="{{appUrl}}/mis-inscripciones" class="btn">Ver mis inscripciones</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Este es tu comprobante de pago. Guárdalo para tus registros.</p>
      <p>© {{year}} Eventos Académicos. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
